CreatorPulse Privacy Policy

Effective date: October 31, 2026

CreatorPulse respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use and protect information when you use our service.

1. Information we collect

Depending on how you use CreatorPulse, we may collect:

- Your email address and account authentication information.
- TikTok account identifiers and permitted profile information.
- TikTok statistics, including followers, likes and video counts.
- Public video information and performance statistics available through TikTok's API.

2. How we use your information

We use this information to provide your analytics dashboard, display account and video performance, track changes in statistics and improve CreatorPulse.

3. TikTok permissions

CreatorPulse accesses TikTok information only after you authorise the requested permissions. We do not ask for your TikTok password.

4. Storage and security

CreatorPulse uses Supabase for account and application data storage. We take reasonable steps to protect your information.

5. Sharing of information

We do not sell your personal information. Information may be processed by service providers necessary to operate CreatorPulse, including Supabase and TikTok.

